  "value": "calls holds [caller, receiver, timestamp] and reports holds [receiver, timestamp], timestamps in the form \"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS\". A report matches a call when the receivers are equal and the timestamps differ by at most window seconds. For each caller count the matching (call, report) pairs over all its calls. Return [caller, count] for every caller with a positive count, ordered by count descending and then caller ascending.",
